@host = localhost:8301
@accessToken = replace-with-login-access-token

### Send HTML mail (requires an access token)
POST http://{{host}}/api/mail HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "user@example.com",
  "subject": "邮件主题",
  "body": "<p>邮件正文</p>"
}
